<title>USA: California Microwave Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>California Microwave Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>March 31,  1997	   March 31, 1996</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $ 0.37	  profit $   0.08</p>
<p> Net  loss	   6,004	 profit     1,325</p>
<p> Revs		  92,857		   100,073</p>
<p>	    Nine  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $  2.06	profit  $    0.62</p>
<p> Net loss	    33,272     profit     10,080</p>
<p> Revs		  313,638		   332,125</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q3 net loss includes restructuring charges of $7.8 million and relocation and retention costs of $800,000. Excluding the $7.8 million restructuring charges, it would have reported a net loss of $791,000, or $0.05 per share for the Q3.</p>
